    "statement": "On the separated double-root extremal locus, once the connected scalar weld leaves its unique full-support vector lambda and Krow lambda=0, define R_lambda(t)=sum_x L_X(x_*)lambda_xP_x(t)/((x_*-x)L_X'(x)). The complete augmented heavy-row coefficient-MDS condition is equivalent to H|R_lambda, where H=g_*S_B^2/gcd(Lambda,g_*S_B^2). Equivalently an explicit (e-2-j) by |X| polynomial-remainder matrix B_H must kill lambda. Thus the huge augmented rank problem reduces to one exact univariate remainder; universal nonvanishing remains open.",
